      "source": "https://www.sandgatemuseum.com.au/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sandgate Library opened in 1952 and received a major refurbishment in 1996, serving as a community knowledge hub.",
